              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palwa fintu fimbi ifya pa bufumu bwakwa Menahemu, elyo na fyonse ifyo acitile, bushe tafyalembwa mu citabo ca milandu ya shamfumu sha bena Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
