              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walenga ikumi limo na isano (50) uwakwa Asaria imfumu ya bena Yuda, Pekaya umwana mwaume wakwa Menahemu ewatampile ukuteeka pa bufumu bwa bena Israeli mu Samaria, kabili ateekele pa myaka ibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
