          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walenga ibili uwakwa Peka mwana Remaliya imfumu ya bena Israeli, Yotamu umwana mwaume wakwa Usia mfumu ya bena Yuda ewatendeke ukuteeka pa bufumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ne myaka amakumi yabili na isano (25) ilyo atendeke ukuteeka, kabili ateekele mu Yerusalemu imyaka ikumi limo na mutanda (16). Nyina ishina lyakwe ali ni Yelusha umwana umwanakashi wakwa Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acitile ifisuma pa cinso cakwa Yawe, ngefyo wishi Usia acitile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo incende shakupepelamo isho balecindika taonawile. Abantu batwalililefye ukutuula amalambo nokoca ububani mulya mwine. Yotamu akuula cipya cipya impongolo ya pamulu iya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
