        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo palwa fintu fimbi ifya pa bufumu bwakwa Yotamu, nefyo acitile, bushe tafyalembwa mu citabo ca milandu ya shamfumu sha bena Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
